 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Cursed Circuitry — Cursed Technique Reversal</em></p><p>Because you have mastered Reverse Cursed Technique, you have gained your technique reversal. Instead of optimizing cursed energy usage, you can cripple a creature’s ability to optimize. As an action for 10 CE, you can target a creature within 5 ft. The target must make a CE saving throw. On a failure, the target takes your CE modifier in necrotic damage for every cursed energy they use for 1 hour as their attempts to utilize cursed energy destroys their bodies.</p>",
